        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Herschell Gordon Lewis, Leah Meyerhoff, William Kerwin, Allison Louise Downe\n- Works: Suburban Roulette\n- Organizations: AllMovie, Student Academy Awards\n- Topics: Film careers, film festivals, international awards, wife swapping, suburban boredom\n\nFacts:\n- AllMovie wrote that Herschell Gordon Lewis was a pioneer of gore films who went farther than others of his era in depicting disgust and discomfort onscreen.\n- Leah Meyerhoff is a director, producer, and screenwriter who was nominated for a Student Academy Award.\n- Leah Meyerhoff's films have screened at more than 200 film festivals worldwide and have won more than a dozen international awards.\n- Suburban Roulette is a 1968 American drama film directed by Herschell Gordon Lewis.\n- Suburban Roulette stars William Kerwin and Allison Louise Downe among others as characters involved in wife swapping to overcome suburban boredom.",
